---
description: >-
  Every edge animation variant side by side — `animate: true`,
  `animation: fast`, `animation: slow`, and `animate: false` — each on its
  own named edge from a shared actor.
---
usecase-beta
    direction LR

    actor Operator
    A("Animate true")
    B("Fast animation")
    C("Slow animation")
    D("Animation disabled")

    Operator trueEdge@--> A
    Operator fastEdge@--> B
    Operator slowEdge@--> C
    Operator offEdge@--> D

    trueEdge@{ animate: true }
    fastEdge@{ animation: fast }
    slowEdge@{ animation: slow }
    offEdge@{ animate: false }
